      scene: "A legal technology firm stores client matters in a document platform with role based access. A client reports that a paralegal from a different practice group could open a merger file. The investigation finds the file was moved between matters last month and the old matter's role assignments stayed attached to it.",
      clock: "The client wants an explanation within 48 hours",
      pressure: "Product wants to patch the move function and close the ticket.",
      prompt: "What do you recommend to the executive team?",
