      debrief: "The bug is a copy of permissions that did not follow the data. Patching the move path fixes one copy among several. Relationship modelling makes the file's access a function of where it sits in the matter graph, so every path (move, copy, restore) inherits correctly, and the lookup API answers the client's question directly. Per matter roles reproduce the copy problem with more objects. Restricting the function pushes the work outside the system.",
